{"id":"soft_dtw_kernel","title":"Exponential soft-DTW divergence","family":"kernel","definition":"reference","intro_en":"This imported atlas name denotes an exponential of the self-corrected soft-DTW divergence. It first includes contributions from multiple alignments, subtracts both self terms, then applies exp(-D/gamma). This explicit construction is separate from directly exponentiating raw soft-DTW or choosing a modified local kernel for GAK.","intro_zh":"本图谱名称对应自修正 soft-DTW 散度的指数形式。先综合多个对齐路径，减去两个自对齐项，再计算 exp(-D/gamma)。该明确构造区别于直接指数化原始 soft-DTW，也区别于为 GAK 选择修正局部核。","steps_en":["Compute cross and self soft-DTW objectives with the same gamma and local cost.","Inspect the diffuse occupancy of alternative alignments.","Subtract the self terms to obtain the corrected divergence D.","Evaluate exp(-D/gamma) using gamma=0.7."],"steps_zh":["使用相同 gamma 和局部代价计算交叉及自对齐 soft-DTW。","检查备选对齐的分散占据权重。","扣除自对齐项得到修正散度 D。","使用 gamma=0.7 计算 exp(-D/gamma)。"],"formula":"K=exp(-D_gamma/gamma); D_gamma=sDTW(x,y)-0.5*sDTW(x,x)-0.5*sDTW(y,y)","caveats_en":["A corrected divergence does not by itself prove that its exponential is a positive-semidefinite kernel for an arbitrary ground cost.","This gamma is used for both soft alignment and the final exponential; a separate outer bandwidth would define another variant."],"caveats_zh":["修正散度本身不能证明对任意局部代价，其指数形式都是半正定核。","这里同一个 gamma 同时控制软对齐与最终指数变换；若另设外层带宽，则得到另一变体。"],"sources":[{"label":"Blondel, Mensch and Vert (2021): corrected divergences","url":"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v130/blondel21a.html"},{"label":"Cuturi and Blondel (2017): Soft-DTW","url":"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v70/cuturi17a.html"},{"label":"EchoTime imported atlas: named formula conventions","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/src/echotime/data/ts_similarity_package_v2_registry.csv"}],"x":[0.2,0.4,1.1,2.4,3.2,2.5,1.2,0.3,-0.4,-0.1],"y":[0.1,0.3,0.5,1.2,2.6,3.1,2.3,1.1,0.2,-0.3],"input_label":"Deterministic illustrative arrays; no benchmark data","parameters":{"gamma":0.7,"ground_cost":"squared Euclidean","divergence":0.2954933934215753},"result":{"label":"kernel score","value":0.6556465577357476,"detail":"The explicit definition and parameters shown on this card."},"frames":[{"phase":0,"caption":"Compare samples to construct the local table","panel":{"kind":"matrix","title":"Local comparison costs","z":[[0.010000000000000002,0.009999999999999995,0.09,1.0,5.76,8.41,4.409999999999998,0.8100000000000003,0.0,0.25],[0.09000000000000002,0.010000000000000007,0.009999999999999995,0.6399999999999999,4.840000000000001,7.290000000000001,3.61,0.4900000000000001,0.04000000000000001,0.48999999999999994],[1.0,0.6400000000000001,0.3600000000000001,0.009999999999999974,2.25,4.0,1.4399999999999993,0.0,0.8100000000000003,1.9600000000000004],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null]],"row_label":"x index","col_label":"y index","cursor":[2,0]}},{"phase":0,"caption":"Compare samples to construct the local table","panel":{"kind":"matrix","title":"Local comparison costs","z":[[0.010000000000000002,0.009999999999999995,0.09,1.0,5.76,8.41,4.409999999999998,0.8100000000000003,0.0,0.25],[0.09000000000000002,0.010000000000000007,0.009999999999999995,0.6399999999999999,4.840000000000001,7.290000000000001,3.61,0.4900000000000001,0.04000000000000001,0.48999999999999994],[1.0,0.6400000000000001,0.3600000000000001,0.009999999999999974,2.25,4.0,1.4399999999999993,0.0,0.8100000000000003,1.9600000000000004],[5.289999999999999,4.41,3.61,1.44,0.04000000000000007,0.49000000000000027,0.010000000000000018,1.6899999999999995,4.839999999999999,7.289999999999998],[9.610000000000001,8.410000000000002,7.290000000000001,4.0,0.3600000000000001,0.0100